r-battery?-1" style="overflow: hidden; transition: height 0.3s; display: none; height: 0px;"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="text-black last:mb-0"><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">There are several ways your vehicle’s battery can drain, including leaving your lights on, a bad alternator, and age can also be a factor.</p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case"></p></div></div></div></div><div class="border-t-2 last:border-b-2 text-type-standard  border-background-100 border-background-100" data-open="false" data-qa-id="accordion-item-_r_9_-what-size-car-battery-do-i-need?-2"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-content-_r_9_-what-size-car-battery-do-i-need?-2" id="accordion-header-_r_9_-what-size-car-battery-do-i-need?-2" class="py-4 pr-6 pl-0 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center w-full border-none text-left gap-6 capitalize bg-transparent paragraph-lg text-type-standard  border-t-background-100 text-type-standard" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-header-_r_9_-what-size-car-battery-do-i-need?-2" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:accordion-container:what-size-car-battery-do-i-need&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;componentType&quot;:&quot;accordion-container&quot;,&quot;componentName&quot;:&quot;accordion-container|accordion-summary&quot;,&quot;componentElement&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;productListAdds&quot;:false}"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="heading-xs !normal-case text-type-standard" id="what-size-car-battery-do-i-need">What Size Car Battery Do I Need?</h3></div><span class="transition-transform duration-300 ease-out flex items-center ml-auto"><i class="icon-chevron-down flex justify-center items-center icon-md " aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-_r_9_-what-size-car-battery-do-i-need?-2-icon-chevron" style="font-size: 24px; width: 24px; height: 24px; color: currentcolor;"><span class="path1"></span><span class="path2"></span><span class="path3"></span><span class="path4"></span><span class="path5"></span><span class="path6"></span><span class="path7"></span><span class="path8"></span><span class="path9"></span><span class="path10"></span><span class="path11"></span><span class="path12"></span><span class="path13"></span><span class="path14"></span></i></span></button><div id="accordion-content-_r_9_-what-size-car-battery-do-i-need?-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-header-_r_9_-what-size-car-battery-do-i-need?-2" class="overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300 ease-in pb-0 px-0 pb-6" aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-details-_r_9_-what-size-car-battery-do-i-need?-2" style="overflow: hidden; transition: height 0.3s; display: none; height: 0px;"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="text-black last:mb-0"><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">Your vehicle’s battery size falls into one of several groups, and is determined by the year, make, model and engine size of your vehicle. If you are unsure of your vehicle’s battery requirements, check your vehicle manual or talk to one of our technicians for the original equipment (OE) manufacturer’s recommendations.</p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case"></p></div></div></div></div><div class="border-t-2 last:border-b-2 text-type-standard  border-background-100 border-background-100" data-open="false" data-qa-id="accordion-item-_r_9_-how-many-volts-is-a-car-battery?-3"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-content-_r_9_-how-many-volts-is-a-car-battery?-3" id="accordion-header-_r_9_-how-many-volts-is-a-car-battery?-3" class="py-4 pr-6 pl-0 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center w-full border-none text-left gap-6 capitalize bg-transparent paragraph-lg text-type-standard  border-t-background-100 text-type-standard" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-header-_r_9_-how-many-volts-is-a-car-battery?-3" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:accordion-container:how-many-volts-is-a-car-battery&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;componentType&quot;:&quot;accordion-container&quot;,&quot;componentName&quot;:&quot;accordion-container|accordion-summary&quot;,&quot;componentElement&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;productListAdds&quot;:false}"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="heading-xs !normal-case text-type-standard" id="how-many-volts-is-a-car-battery">How Many Volts is a Car Battery?</h3></div><span class="transition-transform duration-300 ease-out flex items-center ml-auto"><i class="icon-chevron-down flex justify-center items-center icon-md " aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-_r_9_-how-many-volts-is-a-car-battery?-3-icon-chevron" style="font-size: 24px; width: 24px; height: 24px; color: currentcolor;"><span class="path1"></span><span class="path2"></span><span class="path3"></span><span class="path4"></span><span class="path5"></span><span class="path6"></span><span class="path7"></span><span class="path8"></span><span class="path9"></span><span class="path10"></span><span class="path11"></span><span class="path12"></span><span class="path13"></span><span class="path14"></span></i></span></button><div id="accordion-content-_r_9_-how-many-volts-is-a-car-battery?-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-header-_r_9_-how-many-volts-is-a-car-battery?-3" class="overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300 ease-in pb-0 px-0 pb-6" aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-details-_r_9_-how-many-volts-is-a-car-battery?-3" style="overflow: hidden; transition: height 0.3s; display: none; height: 0px;"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="text-black last:mb-0"><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">Most vehicles have 12-volt electrical systems, but there are some (like hybrid/electric vehicles) that are highly electrified and use higher voltage systems. Some older vehicles used less than 12-volt systems as well.</p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case"></p></div></div></div></div><div class="border-t-2 last:border-b-2 text-type-standard  border-background-100 border-background-100" data-open="false" data-qa-id="accordion-item-_r_9_-how-to-test-a-car-battery?-4"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-content-_r_9_-how-to-test-a-car-battery?-4" id="accordion-header-_r_9_-how-to-test-a-car-battery?-4" class="py-4 pr-6 pl-0 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center w-full border-none text-left gap-6 capitalize bg-transparent paragraph-lg text-type-standard  border-t-background-100 text-type-standard" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-header-_r_9_-how-to-test-a-car-battery?-4" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:accordion-container:how-to-test-a-car-battery&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;componentType&quot;:&quot;accordion-container&quot;,&quot;componentName&quot;:&quot;accordion-container|accordion-summary&quot;,&quot;componentElement&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;productListAdds&quot;:false}"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="heading-xs !normal-case text-type-standard" id="how-to-test-a-car-battery">How to Test a Car Battery?</h3></div><span class="transition-transform duration-300 ease-out flex items-center ml-auto"><i class="icon-chevron-down flex justify-center items-center icon-md " aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-_r_9_-how-to-test-a-car-battery?-4-icon-chevron" style="font-size: 24px; width: 24px; height: 24px; color: currentcolor;"><span class="path1"></span><span class="path2"></span><span class="path3"></span><span class="path4"></span><span class="path5"></span><span class="path6"></span><span class="path7"></span><span class="path8"></span><span class="path9"></span><span class="path10"></span><span class="path11"></span><span class="path12"></span><span class="path13"></span><span class="path14"></span></i></span></button><div id="accordion-content-_r_9_-how-to-test-a-car-battery?-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-header-_r_9_-how-to-test-a-car-battery?-4" class="overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300 ease-in pb-0 px-0 pb-6" aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-details-_r_9_-how-to-test-a-car-battery?-4" style="overflow: hidden; transition: height 0.3s; display: none; height: 0px;"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="text-black last:mb-0"><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">Testing an existing battery is critical to determining the remaining voltage left in the battery.</p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case"></p></div></div></div></div><div class="border-t-2 last:border-b-2 text-type-standard  border-background-100 border-background-100" data-open="false" data-qa-id="accordion-item-_r_9_-how-to-use-a-multimeter-to-test-a-car-battery?-5"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-content-_r_9_-how-to-use-a-multimeter-to-test-a-car-battery?-5" id="accordion-header-_r_9_-how-to-use-a-multimeter-to-test-a-car-battery?-5" class="py-4 pr-6 pl-0 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center w-full border-none text-left gap-6 capitalize bg-transparent paragraph-lg text-type-standard  border-t-background-100 text-type-standard" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-header-_r_9_-how-to-use-a-multimeter-to-test-a-car-battery?-5" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:accordion-container:how-to-use-a-multimeter-to-test-a-car-battery&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;componentType&quot;:&quot;accordion-container&quot;,&quot;componentName&quot;:&quot;accordion-container|accordion-summary&quot;,&quot;componentElement&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;productListAdds&quot;:false}"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="heading-xs !normal-case text-type-standard" id="how-to-use-a-multimeter-to-test-a-car-battery">How to Use a Multimeter to Test a Car Battery?</h3></div><span class="transition-transform duration-300 ease-out flex items-center ml-auto"><i class="icon-chevron-down flex justify-center items-center icon-md " aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-_r_9_-how-to-use-a-multimeter-to-test-a-car-battery?-5-icon-chevron" style="font-size: 24px; width: 24px; height: 24px; color: currentcolor;"><span class="path1"></span><span class="path2"></span><span class="path3"></span><span class="path4"></span><span class="path5"></span><span class="path6"></span><span class="path7"></span><span class="path8"></span><span class="path9"></span><span class="path10"></span><span class="path11"></span><span class="path12"></span><span class="path13"></span><span class="path14"></span></i></span></button><div id="accordion-content-_r_9_-how-to-use-a-multimeter-to-test-a-car-battery?-5" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-header-_r_9_-how-to-use-a-multimeter-to-test-a-car-battery?-5" class="overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300 ease-in pb-0 px-0 pb-6" aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-details-_r_9_-how-to-use-a-multimeter-to-test-a-car-battery?-5" style="overflow: hidden; transition: height 0.3s; display: none; height: 0px;"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="text-black last:mb-0"><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">You can test your vehicle’s battery by using a multimeter, which tells you the voltage of your battery. Fully charged batteries should measure at 12.6 volts or above. When the engine is running, this measurement should be 13.7 to 14.7 volts.</p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">If you are uncertain about how your battery is performing, please visit one of our locations for a battery inspection today.</p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case"></p></div></div></div></div><div class="border-t-2 last:border-b-2 text-type-standard  border-background-100 border-background-100" data-open="false" data-qa-id="accordion-item-_r_9_-how-to-tell-if-a-car-battery-is-bad?-6"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-content-_r_9_-how-to-tell-if-a-car-battery-is-bad?-6" id="accordion-header-_r_9_-how-to-tell-if-a-car-battery-is-bad?-6" class="py-4 pr-6 pl-0 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center w-full border-none text-left gap-6 capitalize bg-transparent paragraph-lg text-type-standard  border-t-background-100 text-type-standard" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-header-_r_9_-how-to-tell-if-a-car-battery-is-bad?-6" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:accordion-container:how-to-tell-if-a-car-battery-is-bad&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;componentType&quot;:&quot;accordion-container&quot;,&quot;componentName&quot;:&quot;accordion-container|accordion-summary&quot;,&quot;componentElement&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;productListAdds&quot;:false}"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="heading-xs !normal-case text-type-standard" id="how-to-tell-if-a-car-battery-is-bad">How to Tell if a Car Battery is Bad?</h3></div><span class="transition-transform duration-300 ease-out flex items-center ml-auto"><i class="icon-chevron-down flex justify-center items-center icon-md " aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-_r_9_-how-to-tell-if-a-car-battery-is-bad?-6-icon-chevron" style="font-size: 24px; width: 24px; height: 24px; color: currentcolor;"><span class="path1"></span><span class="path2"></span><span class="path3"></span><span class="path4"></span><span class="path5"></span><span class="path6"></span><span class="path7"></span><span class="path8"></span><span class="path9"></span><span class="path10"></span><span class="path11"></span><span class="path12"></span><span class="path13"></span><span class="path14"></span></i></span></button><div id="accordion-content-_r_9_-how-to-tell-if-a-car-battery-is-bad?-6" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-header-_r_9_-how-to-tell-if-a-car-battery-is-bad?-6" class="overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300 ease-in pb-0 px-0 pb-6" aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-details-_r_9_-how-to-tell-if-a-car-battery-is-bad?-6" style="overflow: hidden; transition: height 0.3s; display: none; height: 0px;"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="text-black last:mb-0"><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">There are telltale signs that can point to a bad battery. If you experience one of the following items, bring your vehicle contact and bring your car into one of our locations as soon as possible.</p>
<p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">Signs a Car Battery is Going Bad:</p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">
</p><ul class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 !normal-case mb-2"> <li class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary m-0 mb-2 !normal-case">Slowly Starting Car: Upon ignition, listen for the engine to be struggling to turn over.</li> <li class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary m-0 mb-2 !normal-case">Illuminated Indicator Lights: Watch if the dashboard lights indicating the car’s charging system will be on at the time of ignition.</li>
</ul><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case"></p></div></div></div></div><div class="border-t-2 last:border-b-2 text-type-standard  border-background-100 border-background-100" data-open="false" data-qa-id="accordion-item-_r_9_-how-to-clean-car-battery-terminals?-7"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-content-_r_9_-how-to-clean-car-battery-terminals?-7" id="accordion-header-_r_9_-how-to-clean-car-battery-terminals?-7" class="py-4 pr-6 pl-0 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center w-full border-none text-left gap-6 capitalize bg-transparent paragraph-lg text-type-standard  border-t-background-100 text-type-standard" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-header-_r_9_-how-to-clean-car-battery-terminals?-7" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:accordion-container:how-to-clean-car-battery-terminals&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;componentType&quot;:&quot;accordion-container&quot;,&quot;componentName&quot;:&quot;accordion-container|accordion-summary&quot;,&quot;componentElement&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;productListAdds&quot;:false}"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="heading-xs !normal-case text-type-standard" id="how-to-clean-car-battery-terminals">How to Clean Car Battery Terminals?</h3></div><span class="transition-transform duration-300 ease-out flex items-center ml-auto"><i class="icon-chevron-down flex justify-center items-center icon-md " aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-_r_9_-how-to-clean-car-battery-terminals?-7-icon-chevron" style="font-size: 24px; width: 24px; height: 24px; color: currentcolor;"><span class="path1"></span><span class="path2"></span><span class="path3"></span><span class="path4"></span><span class="path5"></span><span class="path6"></span><span class="path7"></span><span class="path8"></span><span class="path9"></span><span class="path10"></span><span class="path11"></span><span class="pa